{"published_at": "Mon, 28 Sep 2026 13:35:00 +0000", "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://medcitynews.com/2026/09/beyond-one-size-fits-all-women-substance-use-and-the-need-for-gender-responsive-care/\"><img width=\"600\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://medcitynews.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2023/11/GettyImages-1403986369-600x400.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto!important;\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" srcset=\"https://medcitynews.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2023/11/GettyImages-1403986369-600x400.jpg 600w, https://medcitynews.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2023/11/GettyImages-1403986369-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medcitynews.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2023/11/GettyImages-1403986369.jpg 724w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" /></a></p><p>While SUD affects people across all demographics, a growing body of research and clinical experience makes one point clear: gender meaningfully influences how substance use develops, how it is experienced, and what supports effective treatment. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://medcitynews.com/2026/09/beyond-one-size-fits-all-women-substance-use-and-the-need-for-gender-responsive-care/\">Beyond One-Size-Fits-All: Women, Substance Use, and the Need for Gender-Responsive Care</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://medcitynews.com\">MedCity News</a>.</p>\n", "tags": [], "title": "Beyond One-Size-Fits-All: Women, Substance Use, and the Need for Gender-Responsive Care", "upstream_id": "https://medcitynews.com/?p=149192", "url": "https://medcitynews.com/2026/09/beyond-one-size-fits-all-women-substance-use-and-the-need-for-gender-responsive-care/"}
