{"published_at": "Mon, 21 Sep 2026 17:20:53 +0000", "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://medcitynews.com/2026/09/how-ai-is-transforming-clinical-documentation-at-intermountain-health/\"><img width=\"724\" height=\"483\" src=\"https://medcitynews.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/08/AI-scribe.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-post-image\" alt=\"doctor man holds a tablet uses Chat GPT on virtual screen for checking disease in laboratory of hospital. virtual x-ray from Chat GPT shows analysis disease. physician do diagnostic infections with Ai\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto!important;\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://medcitynews.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/08/AI-scribe.jpg 724w, https://medcitynews.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/08/AI-scribe-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 724px) 100vw, 724px\" /></a></p><p>Since implementing AI clinical documentation improvement (CDI) tools, Intermountain has seen a 22% point increase in inpatient chart completion during or immediately after rounds.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://medcitynews.com/2026/09/how-ai-is-transforming-clinical-documentation-at-intermountain-health/\">How AI Is Transforming Clinical Documentation at Intermountain Health</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://medcitynews.com\">MedCity News</a>.</p>\n", "tags": [], "title": "How AI Is Transforming Clinical Documentation at Intermountain Health", "upstream_id": "https://medcitynews.com/?p=150084", "url": "https://medcitynews.com/2026/09/how-ai-is-transforming-clinical-documentation-at-intermountain-health/"}
